  "robustness_conclusion": "Under the Phase-1 formula with CAP=5000, many mid/large brands saturate the inbound and pairs terms, so ranking is driven mainly by clipped coverage, lexical diversity, the golden gate, and the mega-brand penalty. Across modest weight changes at CAP=5000, hulu_support remained rank-1 in this candidate set (OBSERVED). However, if CAP is raised (20000\u2013100000), volume-heavy brands can overtake Hulu \u2014 so Hulu is robust under the original capped design, but NOT robust to removing/raising the cap. Selection remains a heuristic.",
